Admin panel

Retana UI includes interaction patterns adapted from the MIT-licensed
admin panel by Maniruzzaman Jubayer:

  https://github.com/jubayer910/Admin-panel

The original work is a Next.js admin with its own CSS modules. This registry
reimplements the behavior on shadcn primitives. It does not include the
original stylesheet, the Roobert font, Hugeicons, or the author's brand assets.

Adapted behavior:

